        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/e6e3f1c77ca1c7c6d8182bfdb9d96019.avif?t=1762137172\" width=1408 height=520 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DVD Store Simulator is a simulation game where you sell popular films, rare figures and board games to earn money and build your own DVD shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORE MANAGEMENT - Improve the customer experience! Organise shelves, display products and make your shop a place where customers can easily find what they are looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/b2e14e701153884dcfb0a48cb1b41a92.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/b2e14e701153884dcfb0a48cb1b41a92.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/b2e14e701153884dcfb0a48cb1b41a92.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ORDER PRODUCT - Manage your stock of DVDs, figures and board games. Follow trends, order popular products and fulfil customer requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/84c68b60172266789055fe7da5cdc54f.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/84c68b60172266789055fe7da5cdc54f.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/84c68b60172266789055fe7da5cdc54f.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GROW - Expand your shop space, add new shelves and display cases, renovate the interior. Develop your shop according to customer demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/4b39b46cfcb444de27c59930f1cbfde1.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/4b39b46cfcb444de27c59930f1cbfde1.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/4b39b46cfcb444de27c59930f1cbfde1.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DVD COLLECTION - Negotiate with collectors, sell or buy rare DVDs and expand your personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/81d7bf531a473eafccd7bcd12dba2653.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/81d7bf531a473eafccd7bcd12dba2653.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/81d7bf531a473eafccd7bcd12dba2653.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PIRATED DVD PRODUCTION –</strong> Download pirated games at the production table, burn them onto DVDs, produce cheaply and earn profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/39b65955029945f4c72a5e895b83dbf5.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/39b65955029945f4c72a5e895b83dbf5.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/39b65955029945f4c72a5e895b83dbf5.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DVD Store Simulator is a simulation game where you sell popular films, rare figures and board games to earn money and build your own DVD shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORE MANAGEMENT - Improve the customer experience! Organise shelves, display products and make your shop a place where customers can easily find what they are looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/b2e14e701153884dcfb0a48cb1b41a92.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/b2e14e701153884dcfb0a48cb1b41a92.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/b2e14e701153884dcfb0a48cb1b41a92.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ORDER PRODUCT - Manage your stock of DVDs, figures and board games. Follow trends, order popular products and fulfil customer requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/84c68b60172266789055fe7da5cdc54f.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/84c68b60172266789055fe7da5cdc54f.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/84c68b60172266789055fe7da5cdc54f.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GROW - Expand your shop space, add new shelves and display cases, renovate the interior. Develop your shop according to customer demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/4b39b46cfcb444de27c59930f1cbfde1.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/4b39b46cfcb444de27c59930f1cbfde1.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/4b39b46cfcb444de27c59930f1cbfde1.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DVD COLLECTION - Negotiate with collectors, sell or buy rare DVDs and expand your personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/81d7bf531a473eafccd7bcd12dba2653.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/81d7bf531a473eafccd7bcd12dba2653.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/81d7bf531a473eafccd7bcd12dba2653.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PIRATED DVD PRODUCTION –</strong> Download pirated games at the production table, burn them onto DVDs, produce cheaply and earn profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/39b65955029945f4c72a5e895b83dbf5.poster.avif?t=1762137172\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/39b65955029945f4c72a5e895b83dbf5.webm?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590330/extras/39b65955029945f4c72a5e895b83dbf5.mp4?t=1762137172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Run a vintage DVD shop! Sell games, figures, board games. Interact with customers, make special collections. Find rare DVDs from the traveller in front of your shop. Grow your shop with online orders and events. Hire staff, manage stock, expand your shop. Live the passion of collecting!",
